{
  "name": "Sales Agent 1 - Outbound (research, score, send)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sales Agent 1: Outbound\n\n1. Set credentials: Google Sheets, Gmail, and Header Auth for Gemini (header name `x-goog-api-key`).\n2. Paste your Sheet ID into every Google Sheets node.\n3. Edit the **Config** node (offer, ICP, booking link, limits).\n4. Keep `autoSend` = false until you have reviewed ~20 drafts.\n5. Test with *Execute workflow* on 3-5 leads before activating.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420
      },
